{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, Nate, I'm on fire! I just set up meetings with movie producers \u2014 my dreams are comin' true!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-b6cdbb34d4416176abbef919", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:56:42.552160+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b6cdbb34d4416176abbef919", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b6cdbb34d4416176abbef919", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow Joanna, nice work! How did it go with those producer meetings?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-a10d683b60dd707403d1e21b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:56:46.669540+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a10d683b60dd707403d1e21b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a10d683b60dd707403d1e21b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! The meetings went really well. I felt confident discussing my script and vision and they seemed interested and excited. They loved the elements of self-discovery in it. It was so validating to be taken seriously. I'm feeling hopeful and inspired about the future!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-54935c597b7be7e2bf4b33e9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:56:50.777395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54935c597b7be7e2bf4b33e9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54935c597b7be7e2bf4b33e9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Way to go, Joanna! Putting yourself out there is really brave and winning recognition for your hard work feels great. It's just like when I win a video game tournament - it feels awesome! I'm so proud of you and so glad you're feeling hopeful and inspired."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-8ab7e12fb48a722e34d3cd8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:56:54.872400+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8ab7e12fb48a722e34d3cd8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8ab7e12fb48a722e34d3cd8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! Your support and encouragement mean a lot. Writing isn't always easy but moments like these make me appreciate it. I'm so thankful for all the opportunities. Last week, I found these old notebooks with my early writings - it was cool to see how far I've come."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-c44614933fee59f56df28660", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:56:58.987021+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c44614933fee59f56df28660", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c44614933fee59f56df28660", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's cool! You must love seeing how you've grown as an artist. Is there a favorite piece from your early writings that stands out to you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-75cdfe342075b8b41cbc0a6c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:03.088309+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "75cdfe342075b8b41cbc0a6c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "75cdfe342075b8b41cbc0a6c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yup, I still remember this story from when I was 10. It was about a brave little turtle who was scared but explored the world anyway. Maybe even back then, I was inspired by stories about finding courage and taking risks. It's still a part of my writing today."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-23f9c966ab9316fbc7017ce6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:07.198778+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "23f9c966ab9316fbc7017ce6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "23f9c966ab9316fbc7017ce6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: You obviously have a passion for writing, and it's funny the story was about a turtle! Their resilience is so inspiring! Take courage and keep pushing yourself with your writing. Great job!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-4cc33723ebd8a22f7090c754", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:11.315484+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4cc33723ebd8a22f7090c754", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4cc33723ebd8a22f7090c754", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! They make me think of strength and perseverance. They help motivate me in tough times - glad you find that inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-aa30d3c63e9f40307d6802f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:15.416191+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa30d3c63e9f40307d6802f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa30d3c63e9f40307d6802f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: What can I say, I love turtles. So, what's been happening with you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-1c945a64e5e356ec5fb46c52", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:19.509580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1c945a64e5e356ec5fb46c52", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1c945a64e5e356ec5fb46c52", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Apart from meetings, I'm working on a project - challenging but fulfilling. How about you? What's been going on?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-bd13debc8887d3db7094c562", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:23.635341+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd13debc8887d3db7094c562", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd13debc8887d3db7094c562", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Just been helping some friends reset their high scores at the international tournament. It's been fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-f5e841617dbfc1d69b4e8bb0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:27.744758+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5e841617dbfc1d69b4e8bb0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5e841617dbfc1d69b4e8bb0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, sounds like so much fun! You're really passionate about gaming. Have an awesome time and keep helping others with those high scores!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-56a48d03b14cd2f9ee6c9b87", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:31.868722+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56a48d03b14cd2f9ee6c9b87", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56a48d03b14cd2f9ee6c9b87", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! It feels good to use my skills to make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-62a6c80c878feb07697702b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:36.007701+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "62a6c80c878feb07697702b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "62a6c80c878feb07697702b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I couldn't agree more! Which is why my meetings are so exciting!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-0bacd35f2ebed785c0e00b8d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:40.132861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0bacd35f2ebed785c0e00b8d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0bacd35f2ebed785c0e00b8d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: On another note, want to come over and try some of this? It's super yummy, just made it yesterday!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-c43edb1e296762d9e4547502", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:44.254984+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c43edb1e296762d9e4547502", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c43edb1e296762d9e4547502", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Mmm, that looks delicious! Is it lactose-free by any chance?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-f1edfe0ce2484cab0db5ff90", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:48.382864+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f1edfe0ce2484cab0db5ff90", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f1edfe0ce2484cab0db5ff90", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yep, I made it with coconut milk so it's lactose-free!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-30a8babf21ca3d8a6f34a701", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:52.492296+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "30a8babf21ca3d8a6f34a701", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "30a8babf21ca3d8a6f34a701", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks so much, Nate! Sure! I'll come over tomorrow if that's fine."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-301da2f476addc1b5cce9778", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:57:56.618398+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "301da2f476addc1b5cce9778", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "301da2f476addc1b5cce9778", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I don't see why not! I'm not doing anything then, so your completely welcome to!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-dc2401b4b74c27e52afe02c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:58:00.771973+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dc2401b4b74c27e52afe02c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dc2401b4b74c27e52afe02c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Awesome! I'll bring some of my recipes so we can both share deserts!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-0292d068a9d7e559a1a6c77f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:58:04.918355+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0292d068a9d7e559a1a6c77f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0292d068a9d7e559a1a6c77f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I'd love that! I've been wanting to try some of your chocolate and rasberry cake for a while now."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-90a13f92feae655a51821f45", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:58:09.039041+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "90a13f92feae655a51821f45", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "90a13f92feae655a51821f45", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: You got it! See you tomorrow!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-b20b25636f427433f35db198", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:58:13.132768+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b20b25636f427433f35db198", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b20b25636f427433f35db198", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: See you then! Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-42/session_26-5ffa7086a62e3d9e5ef6ddd8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:58:17.291936+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ffa7086a62e3d9e5ef6ddd8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ffa7086a62e3d9e5ef6ddd8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
